      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n(ba) to enable consumers in those sectors to request accredited\npersons to give instructions:\n(i) safely, efficiently and conveniently on behalf of the\nconsumers; and\n(ii) to service providers in those sectors;\nfor the performance of actions; and",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n(ba) to enable consumers in those sectors to request accredited\npersons to give instructions:\n(i) safely, efficiently and conveniently on behalf of the\nconsumers; and\n(ii) to service providers in those sectors;\nfor the performance of actions; and",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fc63a02695db4d2950ee4a00c19632a30118b84f4ef36af7e2727a827c18e0e0",
      "skos:note": "Consumers can request accredited persons to give instructions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 After paragraph 56AA(b)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n(ba) to enable consumers in those sectors to request accredited\npersons to give instructions:\n(i) safely, efficiently and conveniently on behalf of the\nconsumers; and\n(ii) to service providers in those sectors;\nfor the performance of actions; and"
    },
    {
