    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 After section 56AC",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n56ACA  Declared types of actions that can be initiated under the\nconsumer data rules\nThe Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare:\n(a) one or more types of actions for which an instruction may be\ngiven under the consumer data rules; and\n(b) for each of those action types—the classes of data holders, of\nCDR data, that are to be action service providers for that type\nof action.\nNote:\nThe classes of data holders specified for an action type will have no\nchoice about being action service providers for that action type.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n56ACA  Declared types of actions that can be initiated under the\nconsumer data rules\nThe Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare:\n(a) one or more types of actions for which an instruction may be\ngiven under the consumer data rules; and\n(b) for each of those action types—the classes of data holders, of\nCDR data, that are to be action service providers for that type\nof action.\nNote:\nThe classes of data holders specified for an action type will have no\nchoice about being action service providers for that action type.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2197c0101ef2ae4022937fffb603ef831d150bb2a77c45eef8af5850de7f2961",
      "skos:note": "Minister may declare types of actions for which instruction can be given under consumer data rules."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 After section 56AC",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n56ACA  Declared types of actions that can be initiated under the\nconsumer data rules\nThe Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare:\n(a) one or more types of actions for which an instruction may be\ngiven under the consumer data rules; and\n(b) for each of those action types—the classes of data holders, of\nCDR data, that are to be action service providers for that type\nof action.\nNote:\nThe classes of data holders specified for an action type will have no\nchoice about being action service providers for that action type."
    },
