      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nFifth case—person is specified in the designation instrument and\nconditions in the consumer data rules are met\n(5) This subsection applies to a person and CDR data if:\n(a) the person, or a class of persons to which the person belongs,\nis specified, as described in paragraph 56AC(2)(b), in the\ndesignation instrument as holding a class of information to\nwhich the CDR data belongs; and\n(b) the CDR data, or any other CDR data from which it was\ndirectly or indirectly derived, was disclosed to the person\nunder the consumer data rules; and\n(c) the conditions specified in the consumer data rules are met.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\nFifth case—person is specified in the designation instrument and\nconditions in the consumer data rules are met\n(5) This subsection applies to a person and CDR data if:\n(a) the person, or a class of persons to which the person belongs,\nis specified, as described in paragraph 56AC(2)(b), in the\ndesignation instrument as holding a class of information to\nwhich the CDR data belongs; and\n(b) the CDR data, or any other CDR data from which it was\ndirectly or indirectly derived, was disclosed to the person\nunder the consumer data rules; and\n(c) the conditions specified in the consumer data rules are met.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-38-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-38-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-38-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-38-logic-alleninterval-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "759f49c96885a4efff9df1ac8766eb47a9e883641498dc4c089b06381bec7e11",
      "skos:note": "Person specified in designation instrument and meets conditions must comply with CDR data rules."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-38",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "38 At the end of section 56AJ",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nFifth case—person is specified in the designation instrument and\nconditions in the consumer data rules are met\n(5) This subsection applies to a person and CDR data if:\n(a) the person, or a class of persons to which the person belongs,\nis specified, as described in paragraph 56AC(2)(b), in the\ndesignation instrument as holding a class of information to\nwhich the CDR data belongs; and\n(b) the CDR data, or any other CDR data from which it was\ndirectly or indirectly derived, was disclosed to the person\nunder the consumer data rules; and\n(c) the conditions specified in the consumer data rules are met."
    },
