      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n(c) the CDR data, or any other CDR data from which it was\ndirectly or indirectly derived, either:\n(i) was disclosed to the person under the consumer data\nrules; or\n(ii) is covered by subsection (2) for the person; and\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nMeanings of key terms  Part 3\nNo. 75, 2024\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n(c) the CDR data, or any other CDR data from which it was\ndirectly or indirectly derived, either:\n(i) was disclosed to the person under the consumer data\nrules; or\n(ii) is covered by subsection (2) for the person; and\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nMeanings of key terms  Part 3\nNo. 75, 2024\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-40-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-40-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "205c21195e5b98f4d904520210121e81c63e908ee1b5194f45094c41e3b77443",
      "skos:note": "Repeal paragraph and substitute with new provision regarding CDR data disclosure."
    },
