      "cml:premiseText": "Paragraph 56BGA(1)(d) ensures the rules can give the authorisation referred to in paragraph (b) of this subsection",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The rules have the authority to disclose information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-43",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "43 After section 56AM",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-43"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n56AMA  Meanings of CDR action and CDR declaration\n(1) A CDR action is an action of a type declared under section\n56ACA.\n(2) A CDR declaration, for a type of CDR action, is the declaration\nunder section 56ACA that declares actions of that type.\n56AMB  Meanings of action service provider and voluntary action\nservice provider\n(1) A person is an action service provider, for a type of CDR action, if\nthe person:\n(a) is within a class of data holders (of CDR data) declared in the\nCDR declaration for that type of CDR action; or\n(b) is a voluntary action service provider for that type of CDR\naction.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n56AMA  Meanings of CDR action and CDR declaration\n(1) A CDR action is an action of a type declared under section\n56ACA.\n(2) A CDR declaration, for a type of CDR action, is the declaration\nunder section 56ACA that declares actions of that type.\n56AMB  Meanings of action service provider and voluntary action\nservice provider\n(1) A person is an action service provider, for a type of CDR action, if\nthe person:\n(a) is within a class of data holders (of CDR data) declared in the\nCDR declaration for that type of CDR action; or\n(b) is a voluntary action service provider for that type of CDR\naction.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-43-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-43-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-43-ss-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "09e1a3f0639fb00e9b3f3f7d713684bfdf16237d0b175dce329f13c3522ad26f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-43",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "43 After section 56AM",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n56AMA  Meanings of CDR action and CDR declaration\n(1) A CDR action is an action of a type declared under section\n56ACA.\n(2) A CDR declaration, for a type of CDR action, is the declaration\nunder section 56ACA that declares actions of that type.\n56AMB  Meanings of action service provider and voluntary action\nservice provider\n(1) A person is an action service provider, for a type of CDR action, if\nthe person:\n(a) is within a class of data holders (of CDR data) declared in the\nCDR declaration for that type of CDR action; or\n(b) is a voluntary action service provider for that type of CDR\naction.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
