      "skos:note": "Person must be within a class of data holders or voluntary action service provider for CDR action. A CDR action is an action of a type declared under section 56ACA."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-43-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "43(1) After section 56AM",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is an action service provider, for a type of CDR action, if\nthe person:\n(a) is within a class of data holders (of CDR data) declared in the\nCDR declaration for that type of CDR action; or\n(b) is a voluntary action service provider for that type of CDR\naction.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-43-ss-1-norm",
