      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “subparagraph (ii), (iii) or (iv)”, substitute “any of\nsubparagraphs (ii) to (ivb)”.",
