      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the section, substitute:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nComplying with the consumer data rules etc.  Part 5\nNo. 75, 2024\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the section, substitute:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nComplying with the consumer data rules etc.  Part 5\nNo. 75, 2024\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024",
