    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-103-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "103(4) Subsections 56EN(3) and (4)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-103-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person, who is required by subsection (3) to advise a CDR\nconsumer for CDR data that some or all of the CDR data was\nincorrect when it was earlier disclosed, must:\n(a) correct the CDR data; and\n(b) disclose the corrected CDR data, in accordance with the\nconsumer data rules, to the recipient of the earlier disclosure;\nif the person:\n(c) is requested to do so by the CDR consumer in accordance\nwith the consumer data rules; or\n(d) is required to do so by the consumer data rules.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A person, who is required by subsection (3) to advise a CDR\nconsumer for CDR data that some or all of the CDR data was\nincorrect when it was earlier disclosed, must:\n(a) correct the CDR data; and\n(b) disclose the corrected CDR data, in accordance with the\nconsumer data rules, to the recipient of the earlier disclosure;\nif the person:\n(c) is requested to do so by the CDR consumer in accordance\nwith the consumer data rules; or\n(d) is required to do so by the consumer data rules.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-103"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-103-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-103-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ed34f08293eeac5c1209817386a3153d0aa8bda8efe1f56b6241be8351ee3f32",
      "skos:note": "Correct and disclose corrected CDR data to recipient upon request or by law.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-103-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "103(4) Subsections 56EN(3) and (4)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 47,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person, who is required by subsection (3) to advise a CDR\nconsumer for CDR data that some or all of the CDR data was\nincorrect when it was earlier disclosed, must:\n(a) correct the CDR data; and\n(b) disclose the corrected CDR data, in accordance with the\nconsumer data rules, to the recipient of the earlier disclosure;\nif the person:\n(c) is requested to do so by the CDR consumer in accordance\nwith the consumer data rules; or\n(d) is required to do so by the consumer data rules.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
