      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "After “CDR data”, insert “, and is not given in response to advice from\nthe accredited data recipient under subsection 56EN(3)”.",
      "skos:definition": "After “CDR data”, insert “, and is not given in response to advice from\nthe accredited data recipient under subsection 56EN(3)”.",
