    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-135",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "135 Transitional—current Data Recipient Accreditor",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-135"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAn appointment:\n(a) under subsection 56CG(1) of the Competition and Consumer\nAct 2010; and\n(b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part;\ncontinues in force (and may be dealt with), on and after that\ncommencement, as if it were an appointment of the CDR Accreditor\nunder that subsection as amended by this Part.\n(2)\nA thing done by, or in relation to, the Data Recipient Accreditor under\nthe CDR provisions before that commencement has effect, on and after\nthat commencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, the\nCDR Accreditor. However, this is not taken to change the time at which\nthe thing was actually done.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nAn appointment:\n(a) under subsection 56CG(1) of the Competition and Consumer\nAct 2010; and\n(b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part;\ncontinues in force (and may be dealt with), on and after that\ncommencement, as if it were an appointment of the CDR Accreditor\nunder that subsection as amended by this Part.\n(2)\nA thing done by, or in relation to, the Data Recipient Accreditor under\nthe CDR provisions before that commencement has effect, on and after\nthat commencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, the\nCDR Accreditor. However, this is not taken to change the time at which\nthe thing was actually done.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-135-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-135-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8992b30f750fcc448226c89cd06cb4700c58b98c975a50c1c22703cdce6a44ef",
      "skos:note": "Continues existing appointment of CDR Accreditor under amended subsection 56CG(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-135",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "135 Transitional—current Data Recipient Accreditor",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAn appointment:\n(a) under subsection 56CG(1) of the Competition and Consumer\nAct 2010; and\n(b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part;\ncontinues in force (and may be dealt with), on and after that\ncommencement, as if it were an appointment of the CDR Accreditor\nunder that subsection as amended by this Part.\n(2)\nA thing done by, or in relation to, the Data Recipient Accreditor under\nthe CDR provisions before that commencement has effect, on and after\nthat commencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, the\nCDR Accreditor. However, this is not taken to change the time at which\nthe thing was actually done."
    },
    {
