      "values:originalText": "Insert:\naccredited action initiator has the meaning given by section\n56AMC.\naction service provider has the meaning given by subsection\n56AMB(1).\nCDR action has the meaning given by subsection 56AMA(1).\nCDR action participant has the meaning given by section 56AMD."
