      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.57",
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, whether or not such a declaration is in force for an entity\nreferred to in subsection (2), the CDR provisions apply in relation\nto the entity to the extent that:\n(a) the CDR provisions relate to a CDR consumer for CDR data,\nand the entity is a CDR consumer for CDR data (or would be\nif the entity were a person); or\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(3) However, whether or not such a declaration is in force for an entity\nreferred to in subsection (2), the CDR provisions apply in relation\nto the entity to the extent that:\n(a) the CDR provisions relate to a CDR consumer for CDR data,\nand the entity is a CDR consumer for CDR data (or would be\nif the entity were a person); or\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-158"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-158-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-158-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5f6251b5607b0aaca345a2c366fcd3c8d83eaeebdfb74f839660ec7bf7ca6868",
      "skos:note": "Applicability of CDR provisions to entities"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-158-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "158(3) Subsections 56AR(2) and (3)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 57,
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, whether or not such a declaration is in force for an entity\nreferred to in subsection (2), the CDR provisions apply in relation\nto the entity to the extent that:\n(a) the CDR provisions relate to a CDR consumer for CDR data,\nand the entity is a CDR consumer for CDR data (or would be\nif the entity were a person); or\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
