    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-161",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "161 Subsection 56AS(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-161"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(1) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, declare that an entity is\na participating entity, for a State or Territory, in one or more of the\nfollowing specified capacities:\n(a) as a data holder of CDR data;\n(b) as an accredited person;\n(c) as a designated gateway for CDR data;\n(d) as an action service provider for a type of CDR action.\nNote:\nAn entity may be declared by class (see subsection 13(3) of the\nLegislation Act 2003).",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(1) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, declare that an entity is\na participating entity, for a State or Territory, in one or more of the\nfollowing specified capacities:\n(a) as a data holder of CDR data;\n(b) as an accredited person;\n(c) as a designated gateway for CDR data;\n(d) as an action service provider for a type of CDR action.\nNote:\nAn entity may be declared by class (see subsection 13(3) of the\nLegislation Act 2003).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-161-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b326a47f8fc5cdfefa0de8dedaa4350e73bbb60e3300da9e14ed3f43b0ea4d55",
      "skos:note": "Declare entity as participating entity in specified capacities."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-161",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "161 Subsection 56AS(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n(1) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, declare that an entity is\na participating entity, for a State or Territory, in one or more of the\nfollowing specified capacities:\n(a) as a data holder of CDR data;\n(b) as an accredited person;\n(c) as a designated gateway for CDR data;\n(d) as an action service provider for a type of CDR action.\nNote:\nAn entity may be declared by class (see subsection 13(3) of the\nLegislation Act 2003)."
    },
    {
