      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "After “this Part” (wherever occurring), insert “in those capacities”.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nMiscellaneous amendments  Part 8\nNo. 75, 2024\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024",
      "skos:definition": "After “this Part” (wherever occurring), insert “in those capacities”.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nMiscellaneous amendments  Part 8\nNo. 75, 2024\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024",
      "cml:asserts": [
