      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “in response to a valid request by a CDR consumer for the CDR\ndata to be deleted”, substitute “if a CDR consumer for the CDR data\nvalidly requests this”.",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “in response to a valid request by a CDR consumer for the CDR\ndata to be deleted”, substitute “if a CDR consumer for the CDR data\nvalidly requests this”.",
