      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In this section:\nICCPR means the International Covenant on Civil and Political\nRights, done at New York on 16 December 1966, as amended and\nin force for Australia from time to time.\nNote:\nThe text of the International Covenant is set out in Australian Treaty\nSeries 1980 No. 23 ([1980] ATS 23). In 2024, the text of a Covenant\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In this section:\nICCPR means the International Covenant on Civil and Political\nRights, done at New York on 16 December 1966, as amended and\nin force for Australia from time to time.\nNote:\nThe text of the International Covenant is set out in Australian Treaty\nSeries 1980 No. 23 ([1980] ATS 23). In 2024, the text of a Covenant\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-56gf"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-56gf-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-56gf-ss-5-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ff497995a9f4bfe8243bcc351813bacac08c91d4499858209736469debcf7cb4",
      "skos:note": "Definition of ICCPR"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024#sch-1-sec-56gf-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56GF(5) Application of the CDR provisions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(5) In this section:\nICCPR means the International Covenant on Civil and Political\nRights, done at New York on 16 December 1966, as amended and\nin force for Australia from time to time.\nNote:\nThe text of the International Covenant is set out in Australian Treaty\nSeries 1980 No. 23 ([1980] ATS 23). In 2024, the text of a Covenant\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
